# LATENCY_CONTRACT guardrail

Read `docs/DESIGN/LATENCY_CONTRACT.md` before changing settle/speculative paths.

## Allowed
- Mid-speech / silence-hint Groq finalize kicks
- Reuse in-flight speculative at speech_end when frames within slack
- Logging `speculativeReuse`, `settleWav`, `pasteCompleteMs`

## Forbidden in a latency slice
- Lower `redemptionFrames` below 79
- Lexicon / FINALIZE_PROMPT / hallucination detector edits “for speed”
- Delivery / Cursor restore redesign
- Claiming DONE from `SPEAKFLOW_SMOKE_WAV` alone
- Paid streaming vendor as required dependency

## Proof
`npm run check:latency-overlap` must stay green. Dom live Cursor row is optional confirmation, not a substitute for the gate.
